Customer Feedback & Complaint Management System
Author: Srikanth Bethamcharla
Project Type: REST API / Backend Application
Framework: FastAPI
Language: Python 3.11+
Database: PostgreSQL
Test Framework: Pytest
Project Overview
The Customer Feedback & Complaint Management System is a backend application for collecting customer feedback, managing complaints, tracking complaint status and assignments, and supporting customer-service workflows.

The API provides endpoints for authentication, users, customers, feedback, categories, complaints, assignments, resolution workflows, SLA tracking, analytics, reports, and audit logs.
Technology Stack
- Python 3.11+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic
- SQLAlchemy
- PostgreSQL
- Alembic for database migrations
- Pytest and FastAPI TestClient
- Uvicorn for running the API
- python-dotenv / project settings for environment configuration
Main Features
- User registration and authentication
- Role-based access restrictions
- Customer management
- Feedback submission, listing, and editing
- Feedback categories
- Complaint creation and management
- Complaint status updates and history
- Agent assignment workflows
- Complaint resolution, closure, and reopening
- SLA tracking
- Analytics and reports
- Audit log records and filtered audit-log retrieval
- Request validation using Pydantic
- Centralized exception handling
- Consistent error response structure
- Duplicate prevention and conflict responses
- Database rollback handling for failed operations
- Automated integration tests
API Modules
The API uses the version prefix configured by API_V1_PREFIX. In the examples below, the prefix is assumed to be /api/v1.
Module	Purpose
Authentication	Registration, login, and authentication-related operations
Users	User management and role-related operations
Customers	Customer records and customer-related operations
Feedback	Submit, view, and edit feedback
Categories	Feedback/complaint category management
Complaints	Create and manage complaints
Agent Assignments	Assign complaints to support agents
Resolution Workflow	Resolve, close, and reopen complaints
SLA	Track complaint service-level agreements
Analytics	Customer feedback and complaint analytics
Reports	Generate and retrieve reports
Audit Logs	View audit records with supported filters and pagination


For the exact endpoints and request schemas, run the application and use the interactive API documentation.
